Notes on the data in this repository, which the licence above does not cover:

The fixture corpus under data/fixtures/ is original writing by the copyright
holder and is covered by this licence. It is SYNTHETIC — Regulations (EU)
2024/9001 and 2024/9002 do not exist. It must not be cited as law.

The real corpus configured in data/corpus.json is EU legislation published by
EUR-Lex, freely reusable under Commission Decision 2011/833/EU. It is not
redistributed here; the ingest pipeline fetches it. The Official Journal
remains the only authentic source.

Nothing in this repository is legal advice.
